                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2a0eca6-2357-3fc1-8861-a2b1a4fbc339",
                        "entry_id": "630fca12-90d8-32ce-8bb5-105c0b4278cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "careerist; social climber"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d666f2e-729e-483e-84d7-5767ec67b041",
                                "sense_id": "f2a0eca6-2357-3fc1-8861-a2b1a4fbc339",
                                "text": "Ста́лин. Ко вся́кой па́ртии, кото́рая побежда́ет, прима́зываются чу́ждые элеме́нты, карьери́сты; они́ стара́ются защити́ть себя́ по при́нципу мимикри́и — бю́сты выставля́ют, ло́зунги пи́шут, в кото́рые са́ми не ве́рят.",
                                "translation": "Stalin. Alien elements, careerists, are attached to any party that wins; they try to defend themselves on the principle of mimicry—they exhibit busts, write slogans that they themselves do not believe in.",
                                "english": "Stalin. Alien elements, careerists, are attached to any party that wins; they try to defend themselves on the principle of mimicry—they exhibit busts, write slogans that they themselves do not believe in."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
